      "description": "Loopy lets you easily generate the tedious, complicated code that\nis necessary to get good performance out of GPUs and multi-core CPUs.\nLoopy's core idea is that a computation should be described simply\nand then transformed into a version that gets high performance. This\ntransformation takes place under user control, from within Python.",
      "dev_url": "https://github.com/inducer/loopy",
      "doc_url": "http://mathema.tician.de/software/loopy",
      "home": "http://mathema.tician.de/software/loopy",
      "license": "MIT",
      "license_family": "MIT",
      "license_file": "LICENSE",
      "summary": "A code generator for array-based code on CPUs and GPUs"
    },
    "build": {
